Version 2.0.

The rollout gateway's response-schema registry
(src/agentcore_rl_toolkit/rollout_gateway/response_schemas.py) vendors the
response-schema dicts from trl/chat_template_utils.py and derives its
chat-template hash table from trl/chat_templates/*.jinja (baseline commit
7073af94).
